	      "lities across the entire enterprise. It can, for example, be used as a heat map to identify areas of "
	      "investment. In some cases, a capability map may also show specific outcomes delivered by these capabi"
	      "lities.\" x:0.5cm w:10cm h:t y:(y+1.8cm) line-break:words
FILL color:white
RECTANGLE x:(textx1-0.03cm) y:(texty1-0.01cm) w:(textw+0.01cm) h:(texth+0.01cm)
